  m_Name: L2008_BowNotShootingArrows
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exerciseNumber: 08
  exerciseName: BowNotShootingArrows
  exerciseTitle: Bow not shooting Arrows
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202453
  exerciseText: Bow is not shooting arrows
  hintText: Are the arrows really not shooting? Or just invisible? Why?
  solutionText: The arrows are being spawned, but they're being spawned at Z = 1000
    which puts them behind the camera so they're not visible. There is an offset
    on the ShootPoint transform but it should be on Z = 0
